+        "same hidden linear prime factor; without seeing that invariant one "
+        "must scan the bounded prime parameter."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: the definition-driven bounded divisor scan is O(n) exact "
+        "arithmetic and at shipping n=6,000,000 is measured in selftest at "
+        "more than a million candidate divisions on typical seeds, while the "
+        "common-factor route takes under 80 exact operations."
