codex
The source confirms the relevant display is equation (1.7), not (1.4); the existing draft mis-cites it. I also found two audit weaknesses in the draft: its “midpoint” attack was guaranteed to fail by forcing equal row parameters, and G5 timed a weaker probe than the strongest in-context attack. I’m correcting those before treating any local gate as evidence.
