codex
One more construction audit found a prior mismatch: planting conditioned on distinct offsets with coprime algebraic cofactors, while `random_candidate` sampled a wider language. I’m making those conditions explicit in the posed problem and sampling candidates from exactly the same hierarchical distribution as the plant. This makes G4 stricter and removes a hidden planting signature.
apply patch
